OL,3,AWebsites taken down across Europe ahead
OL,4,Aof critical cyber-security update
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Finnish and Dutch governments have
OL,7,Ftaken down websites ahead of a planned
OL,8,Fsoftware update to a programming
OL,9,Flanguage which underpins many online
OL,10,Fservices.
OL,12,FTwo critical vulnerabilities with the
OL,13,FPHP programming language, which is
OL,14,Fwidely used across the internet, have
OL,15,Fbeen identified - a fix is being issued
OL,16,Ffor them on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,18,FMultiple cyber-security agencies have
OL,19,Furged organisations to rapidly adopt
OL,20,Fthe updates, or consider taking their
OL,21,Fwebsites offline.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
